WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.580
We are all looking for a reason to feel good.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:12.650
Something so simple, yet somehow made into
something so complicated.

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:17.910
We often have this tendency to think that
we need a reason to feel good about being

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.310
alive.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.460
That we need to do things, own things, and
achieve things.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.750
And perhaps that is the problem.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:33.070
Of course it is important that we participate
in external activities because it stimulates

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:40.120
our experience of life, engages us in the
give and take, and pragmatically speaking,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:46.340
it is required to establish financial stability
and general safety.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:52.790
But the things that we do and acquire should
not be the sole factors by which we derive

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:55.930
feeling good about life.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.800
The material world is in flux.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:06.080
Cycles rotate in ways that are often arbitrary
and out of anyone’s control.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:11.000
What was new and cool last year is likely
not this year.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.390
And things that we once thought would make
us feel good forever, like a nice house, a

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:24.960
cool car, a career promotion, etc. ultimately
at some point fade into the background of

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:32.180
our lives and no longer make us feel the same
level of joy and appreciation compared to

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.990
when we first acquired them.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:42.220
And so, these kinds of reasons to feel good
just become reasons to look for more reasons

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:49.869
to feel good, pushing us further and further
away from ever being able to just simply feel

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:52.200
good.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:58.790
When we depend our ability to feel good on
things outside of our self, we over complicate

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:02.689
something that is inherently simple.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:07.850
The reason to feel good needs no reason beyond
itself.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:13.440
If your goal is to feel good, then you already
have the only reason you need.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.930
You have the spirit of life and positivity.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:24.500
You believe that life is so incredible that
there should be no moment where you do not

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:28.620
feel intoxicated by its bliss.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:03:03.540
So if you are not already, feel good right
now.

